# Targets to delete from the destination on `chezmoi apply`.
#
# claude-tcc-prune swept orphaned TCC (privacy) rows for deleted claude-code
# versions. macOS 27 moved the user TCC database behind an entitlement no
# third-party process can hold, so the sweep cannot work and the script was
# removed. Without these lines a machine that already has it keeps a copy
# forever - deleting the source only stops chezmoi managing it.
#
# Safe to drop once every machine has applied this. Added 2026-10-01.
.local/bin/claude-tcc-prune
.local/lib/dotfiles-test/tcc-prune.sh

# The voice skill was renamed to my-voice because its /voice name hid Claude
# Code's built-in /voice dictation command. Deleting the old target makes the
# built-in command reachable again.
#
# Safe to drop once every machine has applied this. Added 2026-10-23.
.claude/skills/voice
